.TH "OPENSC\-NOTIFY" "1" "06/02/2026" "opensc" "OpenSC Tools"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.\" http://bugs.debian.org/507673
.\" http://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/groff/2009-02/msg00013.html
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * set default formatting
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" disable hyphenation
.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
opensc-notify \- monitor smart card events and send notifications
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBopensc\-notify\fR\ 'u
\fBopensc\-notify\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBopensc\-notify\fR
utility is used to monitor smart card events and send the appropriate notification\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
.RS 4
Print help and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
.RS 4
Print version and exit\&.
.RE
.SS "Mode: customized"
.PP
Send customized notifications\&.
.PP
\fB\-\-title\fR [\fISTRING\fR], \fB\-t\fR [\fISTRING\fR]
.RS 4
Specify the title of the notification\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-message\fR [\fISTRING\fR], \fB\-m\fR [\fISTRING\fR]
.RS 4
Specify the main text of the notification\&.
.RE
.SS "Mode: standard"
.PP
Manually send standard notifications\&.
.PP
\fB\-\-notify\-card\-inserted\fR, \fB\-I\fR
.RS 4
See
\fInotify_card_inserted\fR
in
opensc\&.conf
(default=off)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-notify\-card\-removed\fR, \fB\-R\fR
.RS 4
See
\fInotify_card_removed\fR
in
opensc\&.conf
(default=off)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-notify\-pin\-good\fR, \fB\-G\fR
.RS 4
See
\fInotify_pin_good\fR
in
opensc\&.conf
(default=off)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-notify\-pin\-bad\fR, \fB\-B\fR
.RS 4
See
\fInotify_pin_bad\fR
in
opensc\&.conf
(default=off)\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBopensc\-notify\fR
was written by Frank Morgner
<frankmorgner@gmail\&.com>\&.
